	"data": "Reflection: Saptari → Septarian, or The Character Who Grew With You\n\nThe Find\n\nI pulled a random journal from May 2018. In it, cithoreal is 20 years old (roughly), talking about a psychological horror visual novel he wants to write. He has six characters. One of them is named Saptari — a healer whose outfit is \"held together and sewn by the roots of medical herbs that he keeps all around his outfit.\" The outfit is alive. The roots wrap around. Very organic.\n\nEight years later, the vault knows…",
